               DEFW CURCMD                     ; 4E4D 74 5B
               CP &CF                          ; 4E4F FE CF
               JR Z,NCF25_2                    ; 4E51 28 05
                                               ; call &4A39 in the other page: LMPR is switched first, so that address
                                               ; is how the other listing numbers it
               CALL CALLMB                     ; 4E53 CD BD 42
               DEFW &4A39                      ; 4E56 39 4A

