;;     BORDER COLOUR CHANGE
;;      The colour comes from the low bits of RBCC and is ANDed with E -- the sector number -- so the border changes as
;;      the
;;      head moves. Setting RBCC to zero turns the effect off.
;; --------------------------------------------------------------------

; ---- BCC ---- from &473D
