;; Takes:     A, BC, DE, HL
;; Leaves:    A, F, BC, DE, HL, IX, IY
;;
;; ? drives OUT (HMPR),A; calls CEOS, SETF2, EXDAT, CHANNEL_LENGTH_AND_FLAGS; falls into whatever follows rather than
;; returning.
